<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $47 (FIM 213.46).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $47 (FIM 213.46).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed down $0-3/8 at $47 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 213.46 markka. In Helsinki on Monday, Nokia A closed up 2.00 markka at 215.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed unchanged at $31-5/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 71.81 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.20 markka at 72.40.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded after closing unchanged at $18 on Friday.</p>
<p>Rauma closed down 0.60 markka at 82.20 markka in Helsinki.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
</text>
